          "chunk_id": "s01_c02",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s01_c2_university_michigan_lawrence_livermo",
          "text": "This paper, from the University of Michigan and Lawrence Livermore National Laboratory, introduces G-Delta-UQ, a single-model method for estimating epistemic uncertainty in graph neural networks.",
