          "chunk_id": "s01_c03",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s01_c3_adapting_stochastic_centering_partia",
          "text": "By adapting stochastic centering and partial stochasticity to structured graph data, G-Delta-UQ produces better-calibrated confidence indicators across size, concept, and covariate distribution shifts, and improves downstream tasks like out-of-distribution detection and generalization gap prediction.",
          "expected_role": "method",
          "cue_keywords": [
