          "chunk_id": "s02_c03",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s02_c3_while_computer_vision_community_long",
          "text": "While the computer vision community has long known that confidence quality deteriorates under distribution shift, this behavior has remained under-explored for graph neural networks.",
