          "chunk_id": "s03_c04",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s03_c4_rather_chasing_expressivity_advocate",
          "text": "Rather than chasing expressivity, the paper advocates for epistemic uncertainty quantification to directly modulate confidence indicators.",
