          "anchor_id": "cue_s04_c3_second_g_delta_uq_novel_single_model",
          "text": "Second, G-Delta-UQ, a novel single-model uncertainty method that extends the stochastic centering framework to structured graph data and, crucially, supports partial stochasticity so that only part of the network is made stochastic.",
