          "anchor_id": "cue_s04_c4_third_extensive_empirical_evaluation",
          "text": "Third, an extensive empirical evaluation spanning covariate, concept, and graph size shifts, across the safety-critical tasks of calibration, generalization gap prediction, and out-of-distribution detection.",
